-4720-3d09-93a5-9e5381c20a12> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/bd49848a-a3f7-355d-a8b1-05a07deaba19/domain/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e59ff9d4-0ffe-3dc1-9328-9d3a31861f72> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c8c3950c-88c1-30bc-913c-0499de195565> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/318dd4b7-2c62-3f93-b0a7-094d70c83578> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/4898effa-3b01-36f3-bd9d-431d902faa23> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/bd49848a-a3f7-355d-a8b1-05a07deaba19/observation/4> ;
